------ Hospital Patient Management CRUD Application ------

Database    : hospital_db
Table       : patient

        id              int PK, auto increment
        name            varchar(100)
        age             int
        gender          varchar(20)
        mobile          varchar(15) unique
        disease         varchar(100)
        doctor          varchar(100)
        admission_date  date

------> Requirements

Create a class named PatientManager

1. Connect to Database
Establish a connection to the MySQL database hospital_db.

2. Add Record
Accept all patient field values.
Insert the patient record into the patient table.
Display: "Patient Added Successfully."

3. View All Records
Fetch and display all patient records from the table.

4. Retrieve Record
Accept the patient id.
Find and display the patient record with the given id.
If the record does not exist, display: "Patient Not Found."

5. Update Record
Accept the patient id.
Update the required patient details.
Display: "Patient Updated Successfully."

6. Delete Record
Accept the patient id.
Delete the corresponding patient record.
Display: "Patient Deleted Successfully."

Note: Implement all database operations as methods inside the PatientManager class.